                                "sense_id": "96bc9bbd-87ca-32fe-a9aa-ef7ec7dcc524",
                                "text": "First or Preantepenultimate Milk-molar; Second or Ante- penultimate Milk-molar."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0a23e2f9-5c8d-4f9c-b269-5cf69d21de9c",
                                "sense_id": "96bc9bbd-87ca-32fe-a9aa-ef7ec7dcc524",
                                "text": "In the tautala leaga [colloquial Samoan] the shortening of normal vowels in the antepenultimate and preantepenultimate syllables is very common."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "91d7171f-4a76-4c12-9be4-65ea2dd1e8d5",
                                "sense_id": "96bc9bbd-87ca-32fe-a9aa-ef7ec7dcc524",
                                "text": "…PWs with preantepenultimate and even fifth-but-last stress occur,…"
                            }
                        ]
